========================================
             TEXT WARRIORS              
========================================

HOW TO PLAY:

1. Make sure Python 3 is installed on your computer.
2. Open your Terminal Linux/Mac or Command Prompt Windows.
3. Install the required requests library:
   pip install requests

4. Run the game:
   python TextWarriors.py   (Windows)
   python3 TextWarriors.py  (Linux / Mac)


Though the game is not much, feel free to do whatever you like with it.

If you want to be a loser, you can type "Dev_Tools" EXACTLY when it askes if your are ready. This allows you to cheat by changing your stats. (Using cheats disables sending your completion, though some loser will probably bypass it.)

check the HOF here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OmC5sg7iSknCpfeuy7AyQN-JkGv2B1DpHfSf_W0s4U4/edit?usp=sharing


Enjoy the game and claim your spot in the Online Hall of Fame!

